<p align="center"><a href="//img1.mydrivers.com/img/20251225/d26b326d861046baa30d0a9616bed6da.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="25款苹果产品今年停产：包含7款iPhone" h="400" src="//img1.mydrivers.com/img/20251225/s_d26b326d861046baa30d0a9616bed6da.jpg" style="border: black 1px solid;" w="600" /></a></p>
